      "content": "That's a good start for the summary. To get more granular for the classification part of my paper, could you elaborate more on the \"white genocide\" narrative? I want to understand the specific pseudo-scientific or historical arguments they use to make that claim sound \"logical\" to their followers. What are the specific points they use to justify that sense of urgency?",
